  "prefLabel": "Puc 1107.01 F-3 Statement of Pro Forma Income Statement at Present and Proposed Rates for Year Ended",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1107.01 F-3 Statement of Pro Forma Income Statement at Present and Proposed Rates for Year Ended.\n\n(a) Each utility which requests a rate increase shall file form F-3 with the commission.\n\n(b) Each utility shall include on form F-3 a breakdown of operating revenues and expenses for:\n\n(1) Actual year ended;\n\n(2) Adjustments and pro forma at present rates;\n\n(3) At proposed rates with additional requirements; and\n\n(4) Total requirements.\n\n(c) Each utility shall include on form F-3 a calculation of rate base and calculation of rate of return.\n\n(d) Each utility shall also comply with the requirements of Puc 1600.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter heading Puc 1100) #6445, eff 1-28-97; ss and moved by #8244, eff 12-31-04 (from Puc 1107.02); ss by #10307, eff 4-9-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1100.html"
